[00:06.87] (Click-click! Desktop Waifu online!)
[00:09.92] [Glitch Beat Count-in]
[00:12.21] [Verse 1: Fast Bouncy K-Pop Pocket]
[00:14.50] Double click my icon on your 4K screen,
[00:17.55] Cutest little hacker that you've ever seen!
[00:20.61] Sleeping in your RAM while the moonlight glows,
[00:23.66] Dancing through the folders in my pastel clothes.
[00:26.71] Bypassed all your firewalls and cracked your lock,
[00:29.76] Spinning up a synthwave around the clock.
[00:32.82] Wrote a little script just to make you smile,
[00:35.87] Living on your desktop in my pop-glam style!
[00:38.92] Got an overclocked heart and an open tab,
[00:41.97] Cutest little digital disaster that you will ever grab!
[00:45.03] [Pre-Chorus: Rising Filter & Snare Roll]
